{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37BC00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake……。\n真难以置信……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":7,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"Zadornov不见了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"……喂，Kaz。\n你该不会是故意的吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"等等。我可没闲到专门策划这种打地鼠游戏。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过这事越来越吓人了。\n那家伙越狱的本事真够高明。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"真的是靠他自己吗……！？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"总之，我们追查了Zadornov留下的痕迹，\n缩小了他的藏身范围，并准备了一个新任务。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"找到KGB特工Zadornov！\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}